  "id": "schizoaffective-disorder",
  "term": "schizoaffective disorder",
  "definition": "Schizoaffective disorder is a mental disorder in which a person has both schizophrenia-type symptoms and mood-disorder symptoms, such as depression or bipolar symptoms, during a substantial part of the illness. At other times in the active illness period, delusions or hallucinations occur without prominent mood symptoms.",
